        "en": "Mieszkanie czy dom?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A family moves into a new flat *w Śródmieściu* (in the city centre district), *na czwartym piętrze*. To pay for it they took out *kredyt* (a loan). The old *gabinet* (a study) is now a child's room. But Mum dreams of *dom na wsi* (a house in the country) with *kominek* (a fireplace), *strych* (an attic) and *piwnica* (a cellar)."
      }
    }
